.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-admin 1  "oct-admin " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-admin \- Administer data on a card (including keys and metadata)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct admin\fR <\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR> [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Administer data on a card (including keys and metadata)
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<Admin PIN file>\fR
Optionally, get Admin PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
oct\-admin\-name(1)
Set cardholder name
.TP
oct\-admin\-url(1)
Set certificate URL
.TP
oct\-admin\-signing\-pin\-validity(1)
Configure if user PIN presentation is valid for just one signing operation, or for unlimited signing operations
.TP
oct\-admin\-import(1)
Import a Key onto the card
.TP
oct\-admin\-generate(1)
Generate a Key on the card
.TP
oct\-admin\-touch(1)
Set the card\*(Aqs touch policy (if supported)
.TP
oct\-admin\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
